      .md-content h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e8e8e8; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .md-content h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #c77dff; margin: 28px 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e2e; padding-bottom: 6px; }
      .md-content h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e8e8e8; margin: 20px 0 8px; }
      .md-content p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #b0b0c8; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 12px; }
      .md-content ul, .md-content ol { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #b0b0c8; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 12px; padding-left: 20px; }
      .md-content li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
      .md-content strong { color: #e8e8e8; }
      .md-content code { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; background: #0d0d1a; color: #c77dff; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
      .md-content pre { background: #0d0d1a; border: 1px solid #1e1e2e; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; overflow-x: auto; margin: 12px 0; }
      .md-content pre code { background: none; padding: 0; }
      .md-content table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 12px 0; }
      .md-content th { background: #0d0d1a; color: #c77dff; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #1e1e2e; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
      .md-content td { padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #1e1e2e; color: #b0b0c8; }
      .md-content tr:nth-child(even) td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
      .md-content hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #1e1e2e; margin: 24px 0; }
      .md-content blockquote { border-left: 3px solid #9b5de5; padding-left: 12px; margin: 12px 0; color: #6a6a8a; }
    4:T115f,<h1>AI Artist Video Prompts — Fan Intro Clips</h1>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Short &quot;hi from the artist&quot; intro videos for each AI artist. ~15–30 seconds. Use reference photos as the source image in Kling AI or Runway Gen-3.</p>
<p><strong>Recommended tool:</strong> Kling AI (app.klingai.com) — best for realistic human movement from a photo. Use Image-to-Video mode.</p>
<hr>
<h2>🎸 KADE RIVERS — Fan Intro Video</h2>
<p><strong>Source image:</strong> <code>file_39---81acd140.jpg</code> (studio composite — best full-body reference)</p>
<p><strong>Kling / Runway prompt:</strong></p>
<pre><code>Male rock musician in his late 20s standing in a recording studio, long dark hair, tribal tattoo sleeves, wearing a black t-shirt. He looks directly into the camera with a slight nod, raises one hand in a casual wave, and speaks: &quot;Hey, I&#39;m Kade Rivers. Welcome.&quot; Subtle smile — not grinning, just real. Moody studio lighting, warm amber and teal tones, mixing console and microphone visible in background. Natural head movement. Cinematic, authentic, unpolished.
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Platform use:</strong> Instagram Reels intro, TikTok profile pin, YouTube channel trailer, EPK</p>
<p><strong>Caption idea:</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;Hey. I&#39;m Kade. This is what I do. 🎸&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2>💃 MADISON BLAIR — Fan Intro Video</h2>
<p><strong>Source image:</strong> Use her confirmed reference photo (half-body stage shot or best headshot available)</p>
<p><strong>Kling / Runway prompt:</strong></p>
<pre><code>Young woman in her early 20s, polished pop artist aesthetic, confident and glamorous. She stands facing the camera, slight smile growing into a full confident grin, gives a small wave with her fingers, and speaks: &quot;Hi, I&#39;m Madison Blair — and I&#39;m so happy you&#39;re here.&quot; Hair moves slightly, natural blink, genuine warmth. Background: softly lit, blurred pink and gold bokeh, upscale vibe. Smooth, polished movement. Aspirational and inviting energy.
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Platform use:</strong> TikTok profile pin, Instagram Reels, Spotify canvas intro</p>
<p><strong>Caption idea:</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;Hi, I&#39;m Madison. Let&#39;s have some fun. 💫&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2>🎧 ARIA VALE — Fan Intro Video</h2>
<p><strong>Source image:</strong> <code>aria-vale.jpg</code> (headshot — confirmed)</p>
<p><strong>Kling / Runway prompt:</strong></p>
<pre><code>Young woman, early-to-mid 20s, authentic and magnetic EDM artist. She looks directly into the camera with natural warmth and energy. Gives a genuine smile, slight head tilt, and speaks: &quot;Hey everyone, I&#39;m Aria Vale. The music&#39;s on — let&#39;s go.&quot; Behind her: blurred festival lights and soft blue/purple haze, like backstage at a stage. Hair moves naturally. Energy is real, not performative. Confident but approachable. Cinematic lighting.
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Platform use:</strong> TikTok, Instagram Reels, festival promo clips, Spotify canvas</p>
<p><strong>Caption idea:</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;Freedom in frequency. I&#39;m Aria Vale. 🎶&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2>Generation Tips</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Kling AI:</strong> Go to app.klingai.com → Image to Video → upload reference photo → paste prompt → set duration to 5–10 seconds → generate. Run 2–3 variations and pick the best.</li>
<li><strong>Runway Gen-3:</strong> Similar — upload image, paste prompt, generate.</li>
<li><strong>Settings:</strong> Use highest quality mode available. For Kling: &quot;Standard&quot; or &quot;Pro&quot; mode.</li>
<li><strong>Lip sync:</strong> After generating the video, run through <strong>HeyGen</strong> or <strong>Sync.so</strong> to add real lip-sync to the spoken line. This makes it look like they&#39;re actually talking.</li>
<li><strong>Music bed:</strong> Add a 5-second clip of each artist&#39;s future track under the video when available.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>Next Steps After Videos</h2>
<ol>
<li>Generate intro clips in Kling AI using above prompts</li>
<li>Run through HeyGen/Sync.so for lip sync on the spoken line</li>
<li>Add artist logo overlay at end (use existing logo files)</li>
<li>Upload to TikTok + Instagram Reels as profile-pinned intro posts</li>
<li>Use as Spotify Canvas on first single when released</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<p><em>Created: March 14, 2026</em></p>
